      <activity id="ef361b61-b3a6-5cbc-801f-31e4752738b5" activityNameId="71657c60-6382-5392-9741-092a537360b6" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, high voltage, production from hydro power, at grid</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, high voltage, production from hydro power, at grid
This dataset describes the transmission of high voltage electricity.;
UUID: f911b34d-02e2-3bd2-ac68-530470dfe9e2
Included are the hydropower electricity production in Switzerland, the transmission network and direct emissions to air (ozone and N2O). Electricity losses are accounted for.
Location: Data apply to public and self producers. Geographical classification according to IEA. Ozone- and NO2-emission factors are based on published measurements made in various countries.  Assumptions for transmission network, losses and emissions are based on UTCE data.
Technology: Average technology used to transmit and distribute electricity. Includes underground and overhead lines. Electricity production according to related datasets
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Statistical data 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f911b34d-02e2-3bd2-ac68-530470dfe9e2.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
